     * `n*x`, `x+n`, `n*x+n` → `.affine` of the corresponding integer-affine
       `IdxExpr`, built directly from the slot's pieces. -/
 partial def elabTLLHSSlot : Syntax → MetaM LHSSlot
+  | `(tl_lhs_slot| $t:tl_axis_term $[+ $ts:tl_axis_term]* $[+ $b:num]?) => do
